255
00:10:03,270 --> 00:10:04,305
MIKE:
Wow.

256
00:10:04,338 --> 00:10:06,440
- Though yet of Hamlet
our dear brother's death

257
00:10:06,473 --> 00:10:09,777
the memory be green,
and that it us befitted

258
00:10:09,810 --> 00:10:12,145
to bear our hearts in grief
and our whole kingdom,

259
00:10:12,178 --> 00:10:14,848
yet so far hath discretion
fought with nature

260
00:10:14,882 --> 00:10:17,217
that we with wisest sorrow
think on him,

261
00:10:17,283 --> 00:10:19,487
